{"overview":"داستان یامان، یک کارآفرین موفق که به دلیل دوران کودکی‌اش که دردناک بود، قادر به عشق ورزیدن نیست. تنها شخصی که برای او احساس می‌کند، برادرزاده‌اش جوان یوسف است. وقتی مادر یوسف ناگهان می‌میرد، عمه‌اش شاهر، زن جوان زیبا و شجاع، وارد خانه خانوادگی می‌شود تا از او مراقبت کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The story of Yaman, a successful businessman who is incapable of love because of his traumatic childhood. There is only one person that he feels something for, his young nephew Yusuf. When Yusuf's mother dies unexpectedly, his aunt Seher, a beautiful, courageous young woman, moves into the family mansion to take care of him.","tagline_en":"","runtime":60,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":205,"y":2020,"poster":"/xXeRBGpKp58Sh7aQq5PlHlTvEtf.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":283,"y":2021,"poster":""},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":205,"y":2022,"poster":""},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":45,"y":2023,"poster":""}],"episodes":738,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Halil İbrahim Ceyhan","role":"Yaman","photo":"/8OQSsKvmetwJbx46TOlfIVEgHCp.jpg"},{"name":"Berat Rüzgar Özkan","role":"Yusuf","photo":"/zYigM7YFoEsKQxoDisFeB2yeiMM.jpg"},{"name":"Binnaz Ekren","role":"Adalet","photo":"/9BYC0j6KEnE0ejZiWUW0RXI1p7m.jpg"},{"name":"Ömer Gecü","role":"Cenger","photo":"/1SLewcSl4WUTzVHGqtuUj2u9nDf.jpg"},{"name":"Adnan Mehmet Ali Aslan","role":"Ibrahim","photo":"/s2AWZCGlVAOXiCknh4Z2KCos5Xb.jpg"},{"name":"Oğuz Yağcı","role":"Nedim","photo":"/t60op3mSYie7lFMoVlQmha99ljC.jpg"},{"name":"Volkan Yildirim","role":"Kirpi","photo":"/qM7FudyMbZgaEZoZYJIjWZubDRz.jpg"},{"name":"Özge Agyar","role":"Karanfil","photo":"/dyx6sQD0hSFDbC63ISXGaLmJizK.jpg"},{"name":"Nanuka Stambolishvili","role":"Nana","photo":"","en":"Nana Stambolishvili"},{"name":"Derya Oğuz Ertün","role":"Firat","photo":"/hpbwNZGBRatRLIFxEh5L5VRzm6v.jpg"},{"name":"Tolga Pancaroğlu","role":"Ziya","photo":"/l7dV1jZEO09inWXuxe6rFhraYeg.jpg"},{"name":"Ferda Işıl","role":"Sultan Hala","photo":"/x